@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333/api

### A API está viva?
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ======== LOGINS ========
### Login do admin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@wiaflow.local",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

### Login da Ana (vendedora)
# @name loginAna
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@wiaflow.local",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@tokenAna = {{loginAna.response.body.accessToken}}

### Quem sou eu? (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ======== USUÁRIOS E ESTÁGIOS ========

### Listar usuários (ADMIN -> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ana tenta listar usuários (-> 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### Estágios (-> 200; usado nos testes de mover)
# @name stages
GET {{baseUrl}}/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### ======== CONVERSAS (Passo 16) ========

### ADMIN lista todas (-> 8)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Busca por nome (-> só Mariana)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations?search=mari
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Busca por telefone (-> só Felipe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations?search=1991207788
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ana lista as dela (-> 4)
# @name convAna
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### Ana abre uma conversa dela (-> 200 com mensagens)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### Conversa que não existe (-> 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/id-que-nao-existe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ======== MOVER, ATRIBUIR, EDITAR (Passo 17) ========

### Ana move a 1ª conversa dela para "Proposta enviada" (-> 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageId": "{{stages.response.body.$[2].id}}"
}

### Histórico da conversa (-> a mudança aparece no topo, com o nome da Ana)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### Ana edita o valor estimado (-> 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estimatedValue": 3500.50
}

### Ana tenta atribuir (VENDEDOR não pode -> 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedToId": null
}

### Estágio inválido (-> 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageId": "estagio-que-nao-existe"
}

### ======== ESTÁGIOS: EDITAR, REORDENAR, ARQUIVAR (Passo 18) ========

### Estágios vistos pelo admin (-> 200 com 6)
# @name stagesAdmin
GET {{baseUrl}}/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Renomear "Qualificação" (-> 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/stages/{{stagesAdmin.response.body.$[1].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Qualificação do lead",
  "color": "#6D28D9"
}

### Trocar a ordem das duas primeiras colunas (-> 200, lista na nova ordem)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/stages/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [
    "{{stagesAdmin.response.body.$[1].id}}",
    "{{stagesAdmin.response.body.$[0].id}}",
    "{{stagesAdmin.response.body.$[2].id}}",
    "{{stagesAdmin.response.body.$[3].id}}",
    "{{stagesAdmin.response.body.$[4].id}}",
    "{{stagesAdmin.response.body.$[5].id}}"
  ]
}

### Reordenar faltando estágio (-> 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/stages/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": ["{{stagesAdmin.response.body.$[0].id}}"]
}

### Criar estágio temporário (-> 201)
# @name novoEstagio
POST {{baseUrl}}/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estágio de teste"
}

### Arquivar o estágio temporário (sem conversas -> 200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/stages/{{novoEstagio.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Arquivar "Perdido" sem dizer para onde mover (tem conversa -> 409)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/stages/{{stagesAdmin.response.body.$[5].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ana tenta renomear estágio (VENDEDOR não pode -> 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/stages/{{stagesAdmin.response.body.$[1].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nome da Ana"
}